# Start Whitelist: track only curated safe config; ignore everything else by default
*
!.gitignore

# Core OBS settings
!global.ini
!user.ini
# Profiles and scenes
!basic/
!basic/scenes/
!basic/scenes/**
!basic/profiles/
!basic/profiles/*/basic.ini

# Project assets (manually place media here to keep scenes portable)
!assets/
!assets/**

# TODO(SECRETS):
# On first NixOS build, use a single MASTER sign-in to decrypt secrets across entire system.
# (e.g., SOPS/age or git-crypt) and materialize cookie/auth state
# locally. Eventually we will store (encrypted versions) of these in the repo and remove need for whitelisting like this when we get there.

# (Whitelist model means locally installed plugin binaries are ignored by default.)

